    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bienvenid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa. Estaba esperándote.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E00760065006E0069006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002E002000450073007400610062006100200065007300700065007200E1006E0064006F00740065002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mademoiselle Lilette te aguarda, así que debes\ndirigirte al área de combate de la Sociedad de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nCombates de Luminalia sin demora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Algún problema? Tan solo hay que bajar las\nescaleras.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY, como ya sabrás, mademoiselle Lilette no\nsoporta que la hagan esperar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, querid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C002000710075006500720069006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No sabes cuán agradecida estoy de que pidieses\nla celebración de los Juegos Z-A Infinitos como<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndeseo por haber alcanzado el rango A.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me hizo tan feliz que he decidido organizar mi\npropio torneo. Lo he llamado...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Torneo Lilette Suprême D!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10054006F0072006E0065006F0020004C0069006C00650074007400650020005300750070007200EA006D006500200044002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tienes alguna idea de qué significa esa <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>D<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>,\nquerid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005400690065006E0065007300200061006C00670075006E00610020006900640065006100200064006500200071007500E90020007300690067006E006900660069006300610020006500730061002000100002FF000006004400100002FF000000002C000A00710075006500720069006400100003110000FF0101006F0061003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Divino?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0044006900760069006E006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Divertido?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00440069007600650072007400690064006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Dos?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0044006F0073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Dónde me he metido?...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004400F3006E006400650020006D00650020006800650020006D0065007400690064006F003F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Incorrecto! Eso se sobreentiende por mi sola\npresencia. Resultaría redundante.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En cierto modo no te equivocas.\n¡Será un torneo divertido donde los haya!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Magnífico! ¡Así es!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00610067006E00ED006600690063006F0021002000A10041007300ED002000650073002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero bueno! ¡No seas maleducad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000650072006F0020006200750065006E006F0021002000A1004E006F002000730065006100730020006D0061006C00650064007500630061006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un torneo solo para nosotr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas dos. Tú contra mí.\n¡El Torneo Lilette Suprême D!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque me venzas... ¡tendrás que volver a\nenfrentarte a mí!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410075006E0071007500650020006D0065002000760065006E007A00610073002E002E002E002000A100740065006E0064007200E10073002000710075006500200076006F006C00760065007200200061000A0065006E006600720065006E00740061007200740065002000610020006D00ED002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y, además, ¡podrás seguir desafiándome tantas\nveces como quieras! Ganes o no el torneo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Entiendes ya de qué va esto?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0045006E007400690065006E00640065007300200079006100200064006500200071007500E90020007600610020006500730074006F003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Diría que sí",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069007200ED006100200071007500650020007300ED0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿De qué me habla?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0044006500200071007500E90020006D00650020006800610062006C0061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Otra respuesta con D! ¡Nunca decepcionas,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, querid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F007400720061002000720065007300700075006500730074006100200063006F006E002000440021002000A1004E0075006E0063006100200064006500630065007000630069006F006E00610073002C000A0010000201000000002C002000710075006500720069006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De verdad... Si lo que quieres es escuchar mi voz,\nhay formas más eficaces de hacerme hablar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, no perdamos más tiempo. Estoy segura\nde que podrás apreciarlo mucho más una vez lo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhayas probado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Empecemos el torneo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006D0070006500630065006D006F007300200065006C00200074006F0072006E0065006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En otro momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
